{"product_id":"girls-night-in","title":"Girls Night in","description":"\u003cp\u003eGirls' Night In is a playful and practical illustrated guide to creating spa parties sure to nourish the soul and soothe the body. Divided by season, each spa party, 12 in all, features a fun theme and includes fresh spa concoctions, activities, and foods, as well as music and decorating suggestions. Jennifer Worick presents a plethora of ideas, including the invigorating spring spa, designed to revitalize skin and spirit after the cold winter months; the energizing honey spa, certain to put new life in tired engines; and the classic slumber spa, in which pajamas, giggling, and gossip are mandatory. She's also taken some of the hottest spa treatments, such as a hot stone massage, cranial-sacral massage, and crystal therapy, and translated them for easy at-home use. Covering the basics, from invitations to the properly stocked spa pantry, the book also provides sidebars throughout that offer handy information on topics such as manicures and pedicures; the proper way to wash one's face; quotes and advice on beauty, health, and wellness; and tips from spas around the country.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:9 x 178  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jennifer Worick \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781843402190 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41761683374233,"sku":"7RB9781843402190","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/a8ce18a1f748160c5e53890759b4cd11.jpg?v=1716389432","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/girls-night-in","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}